      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I need to put together a 5-day itinerary for my director. They are hitting Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City for meetings. Can you help me map out a schedule that minimizes travel time between cities and includes business-class hotel options and spots for formal dinners?",
